{"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Quote an image job. Pass API fields such as model, num_images (up to 10, subject to per-model caps), quality and resolution.\nKling Image 4.0 models:\n- kling-4-image: resolution 2K (default), 4K or 8K (no 1K); result_type=\"single\" (1-9 images) or \"series\" (2-10 coherent images); up to 10 reference_image_urls and up to 7 elements (frontal_image_url + 1-3 reference_image_urls each; elements require >= 1 reference_image_urls; refs + elements <= 10).\n- kling-4-long-image: 1 long vertical image; skill=\"webpage\" (default; optional style_image_url and subject_image_url, no reference_image_urls) or skill=\"ecommerce\" (1-3 required reference_image_urls, length=\"short\"|\"medium\"|\"long\", no style/subject URLs); resolution 1K (default) or 2K.\nFor topaz-image-upscale, crystal-upscale or runway-image-upscale use estimate_image_upscale.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"ImageEstimate":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"aspect_ratio":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Aspect Ratio"},"background":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["auto","opaque","transparent"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Background mode for models advertising 'transparent_background' in features (GPT Image 2.6, Seedream 5.5). 'transparent' cannot be combined with output_format='jpeg'.","title":"Background"},"complexity":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["low","medium","high"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Complexity"},"creativity":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["raw","low","medium","high"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Creativity"},"elements":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/PublicKlingImageElement"},"maxItems":7,"type":"array"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Elements"},"frame_count":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":16.0,"minimum":2.0,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Frame Count"},"frame_duration_ms":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":2000.0,"minimum":20.0,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Frame Duration Ms"},"image_style_reference